  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to  health - Access to health</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">H&#xe4;lsost&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to increase the access to health care to the population in eight departments in the country (around 40% of the population). The project is part of the Honduran Health reform and works with local participation and decentralisation of the Health services.</narrative>
  </description>
